### 1. Set Up Your Vehicle Class
Start by creating a custom vehicle class, typically inheriting from `AWheeledVehicle` or `APawn`, depending on your needs.

```cpp
// MyCustomVehicle.h
#pragma once

#include "CoreMinimal.h"
