This ensures that all user algorithms conform to a known contract, making integration easier.

---

### 2. Provide a Template or Skeleton for Users
Offer a sample implementation or a code template that users can modify. For example:

```java
public class MyCustomAlgorithm implements TradingAlgorithm {
    @Override
    public void initialize() {
        // Initialization code
    }

    @Override
    public void execute(List<StockData> data) {
        // User's trading logic
