## Summary

| Pattern | Purpose | Example Usage |
|---------|---------|--------------|
| Component Composition & HOCs | Reusability & logic injection | Auth HOC, layout components |
| Data Fetching (SSR/SSG/ISR) | Optimize data loading | getStaticProps, getServerSideProps |
| State Management | Shared state | Context API, Redux, Zustand |
| API Layer Abstraction | Centralize API calls | Repository pattern |
| Custom Hooks | Reusable logic | useWindowSize, useAuth |
| Error Boundaries | Graceful error handling | ErrorBoundary component |

